      "endSeconds": 886.26,
      "audiblePhrase": "So Amy and Josh, thanks for coming in. I've read your draft proposal for the Sports Science Study. Perhaps you could start by reminding me what you're actually trying to find out. Well, originally we wanted to look at how diet affects sprinting speed, so now we're focusing specifically on how the amount of sleep athletes get affects their reaction times.",
